        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-19T08:26:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is this second template parameter used for in practice?",
      "revId": "75bd2c5324f528b1bc36a2ec14966c93e288adb1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9c9bffed_7d2821ab",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BlockInfo.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 48,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-19T13:30:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This allows us to construct these types with literal values, rather than explicitly constructed TypedIntegers. TypedIntegers can be constructed from literal values, like `TexelCount(2)`, and for TexelOrigin3D we can do the same: `TexelOrigin3D(2, 3, 4)`. Without this constructor, we\u0027d have to do `TexelOrigin3D(TexelCount(2), TexelCount(3), TexelCount(4))`.",
      "parentUuid": "1fe898f9_3427873c",
      "revId": "75bd2c5324f528b1bc36a2ec14966c93e288adb1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d6e097dd_4ee0732f",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BlockInfo.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 48,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-19T13:42:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is that mostly useful for tests? If we keep the implicit constructor from `Origin3D `we can do `TexelOrigin3D({1, 2, 3})` which isn\u0027t terrible. Likewise IMHO we should expose easier constructors only on `Texel*` to avoid mistakenly creating block values. (most folks think in texels, and if things are in blocks, the types will force use of blocks).",
      "parentUuid": "9c9bffed_7d2821ab",
      "revId": "75bd2c5324f528b1bc36a2ec14966c93e288adb1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d12f9079_8a3c722c",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BlockInfo.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 53,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-19T08:26:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not 100% sure of the value of having this be a template, but also if it weren\u0027t a template, we could have the conversion from/to Origin3D/Extent3D only for the Texel version as they always are in texels in webgpu.h",
      "revId": "75bd2c5324f528b1bc36a2ec14966c93e288adb1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1e8c8845_dbdf10a2",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BlockInfo.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 53,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-19T13:30:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a fair point. In fact, currently I have no instances of BlockOrigin3D or BlockExtent3D, although I think we will in a future CL. I suggest we keep this as is until I do the \"use blocks everywhere\" pass we discussed, and let\u0027s see what it looks like?",
      "parentUuid": "d12f9079_8a3c722c",
      "revId": "75bd2c5324f528b1bc36a2ec14966c93e288adb1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "07296b0f_34155c5d",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/BlockInfo.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 53,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-19T13:42:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Or reintroduce the constructors there if needed? I think it would be a logic mistake if someone takes an `Origin3D` and makes a `BlockOrigin3D` from it directly. We can make the following work: `BlockOrigin3D foo \u003d blockInfo.ToBlock(myOrigin3D)` (using the implicit constructor of `TexelOrigin3D` from `Origin3D`) though.",
      "parentUuid": "1e8c8845_dbdf10a2",
      "revId": "75bd2c5324f528b1bc36a2ec14966c93e288adb1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
